#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:3
#: 23f077f099bc4f7c8b440bdbe24f5381
msgid "磁矩扰动（Spin Perturb）"
msgstr "Spin Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:5
#: a1923e3b3a3d4d33af7c05fa200de24e
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:7
#: 99297ebc6f544e96aaf6d4fb0482e11d
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:9
#: 29baa0de8d584044995a488f007e9806
msgid "围绕输入已有的磁态生成随机局部扰动样本。每个命中的非零磁矩在当前方向周围的球冠内独立采样，并可同时改变模长；每个输入严格生成指定数量的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Generate random local perturbation samples around the input's existing magnetic "
"state. Every matched nonzero moment is sampled independently within a spherical cap "
"around its current direction, and its magnitude may be varied at the same time. Each "
"input produces exactly the requested number of outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:11
#: 93117b74c17146568085f14a228dec58
msgid "输入优先读取标准 `spin:R:3`，没有时兼容 ASE 的 `initial_magmoms`。标量磁矩必须先沿指定笛卡尔方向转成三维矢量。"
msgstr ""
"The card reads standard `spin:R:3` first and falls back to ASE `initial_magmoms` when"
" it is absent. Scalar moments must first be converted to three-dimensional vectors "
"along a specified Cartesian direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:13
#: 02e0fb60cdb54a1d9c612f4b097835bb
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:15
#: 1f38da0d6be34e928c12f4ea3fb2f4ef
#, python-brace-format
msgid "令 $\\hat{\\mathbf m}_i$ 为目标原子 $i$ 的原始磁矩方向。程序在以它为中心、半角为 $\\alpha_{\\max}$ 的球冠内按立体角均匀采样："
msgstr ""
"Let $\\hat{\\mathbf m}_i$ be the original moment direction of target atom $i$. The "
"program samples uniformly in solid angle within a spherical cap centered on that "
"direction with half-angle $\\alpha_{\\max}$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:17
#: 155a22a39cd84efeb3eeac58af329110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\cos\\theta_i\\sim U(\\cos\\alpha_{\\max},1),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\phi_i\\sim U(0,2\\pi),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"0\\leq\\theta_i\\leq\\alpha_{\\max}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:25
#: f8af856b587147cfa6e0464234ef846b
msgid ""
"$\\theta_i$ 就是新旧磁矩之间的真实夹角，$\\phi_i$ "
"是绕原磁矩方向的方位角。这样不会把内部“随机旋转轴”暴露给用户，也不会让采样参数和实际偏转角不一致。界面中的“标量抬升方向”只在标量输入转为矢量时使用。"
msgstr ""
"$\\theta_i$ is the true angle between the old and new moments, and $\\phi_i$ is the "
"azimuth around the original moment direction. This avoids exposing an internal "
"`random rotation axis` and keeps the sampling parameter consistent with the actual "
"tilt angle. `Scalar lifting direction` in the interface is used only when scalar "
"input is converted to vectors."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:27
#: c6121f7cf91445bcaff4ef50e8283bfa
msgid "开启模长采样后，再独立采样："
msgstr "With magnitude sampling enabled, the program also samples independently"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:29
#: 0e0edff35bca44279e0e1e7611f2b10c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_i\\sim U(f_{\\min},f_{\\max}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf m_i'=\\lambda_i\\widetilde{\\mathbf m}_i.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:35
#: 15c75c58378c45dc9b89dfa91246addc
msgid "关闭模长采样时 $\\lambda_i=1$。最大角度设为 0 时，可以只生成模长扰动样本。"
msgstr ""
"When magnitude sampling is disabled, $\\lambda_i=1$. Setting the maximum angle to "
"zero generates magnitude-only perturbation samples."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:37
#: 7732e1d8c6a84ebe80c3f99312b306cf
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:39
#: d0fab1af4fd2453ea019f4f71d972cf1
msgid "补充参考磁态周围的训练样本"
msgstr "Add Training Samples around a Reference Magnetic State"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:41
#: f42459b910de4e46b8a486c23639f1d8
msgid "若训练集主要是严格 FM/AFM 构型，希望模型同时覆盖方向与模长涨落，可从已有参考磁态出发："
msgstr ""
"If a training set consists mainly of ideal FM/AFM configurations and should also "
"cover directional and magnitude fluctuations, start from an existing reference "
"magnetic state:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:43
#: fa15ec78a13c44818f737803c804e007
msgid "最大偏转角使用默认的 `30°`，覆盖明显偏离参考磁态的方向涨落；"
msgstr ""
"use the default maximum tilt of `30°` to cover directional fluctuations that "
"noticeably depart from the reference state;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:44
#: cc60d6db31e842a5af77fe54119af640
msgid "模长范围使用默认的 `0.8–1.2`，同时覆盖约 ±20% 的纵向涨落；"
msgstr ""
"use the default magnitude range `0.8–1.2` to cover approximately ±20% longitudinal "
"fluctuations;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:45
#: 9c31cc83fabb43cd857ffd05281b2783
msgid "每个输入生成 `5` 个结构并固定 seed；"
msgstr "generate `5` structures per input with a fixed seed;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:46
#: 77e2b712d5a34299a7b30b3f40521bf0
msgid "重训后在独立的磁矩扰动测试集上比较误差，并检查输出磁矩的实际最大偏转和模长范围。"
msgstr ""
"after retraining, compare errors on an independent moment-perturbation test set and "
"inspect the realized maximum tilt and magnitude range in the outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:48
#: d6680cc35f0941bd882714928dc7778a
msgid "只想扰动 Fe 时，将目标元素填为 `Fe`；留空则选择所有非零磁矩原子。"
msgstr ""
"To perturb only Fe, enter `Fe` as the target element. Leave it empty to select every "
"atom with a nonzero moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:50
#: eba22b3731c04684908659261b2fc22b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:52
#: 950b623df33d4f3da80696f9d8f7fd99
msgid "目标元素（elements）"
msgstr "Target Elements (elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:54
#: c4054918662b4c298c4acec8fff707eb
msgid "`str`，默认空。使用逗号或空格分隔元素符号，例如 `Fe,Ni`。留空选择所有非零磁矩原子；填写后，所有命中的非零磁矩都会参与每个输出的独立随机扰动。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Separate element symbols with commas or spaces, for example "
"`Fe,Ni`. Empty selects all atoms with nonzero moments. When specified, every matched "
"nonzero moment participates in an independent random perturbation in each output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:56
#: 83ee05756ab04f899203bec38388b160
msgid "最大偏转角（max_angle）"
msgstr "Maximum Tilt Angle (max_angle)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:58
#: 35d023ba5f5041b1bc455f251887a3df
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `30.0`，单位度，范围 "
"`0–180`。它是新旧磁矩真实夹角的上界；球冠内按立体角均匀采样，不是每个原子都固定偏转该角度。需要小角度响应路径时使用“可控自旋倾斜”。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `30.0`, in degrees, range `0–180`. This is the upper bound on the "
"true angle between old and new moments. Sampling is uniform in solid angle within the"
" spherical cap; atoms are not all tilted by exactly this angle. Use `Local Magnetic "
"Response` for controlled small-angle response paths."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:60
#: 769c2f61d72d4ef9898dbcfc49999fcc
msgid "每个输入生成（num_structures）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (num_structures)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:62
#: 5b64ee17e4234d9d9a214d565ab90156
msgid "`int`，默认 `5`，至少为 1。总输出数为："
msgstr "`int`, default `5`, with a minimum of 1. The total output count is:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:64
#: e2dcf8bae91e4628bb70ad66049784d6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times\\texttt{num\\_structures}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:68
#: 4bf7ebc06b6948ce88ae6f5d677d15cb
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:70
#: a2918f7a9cf04bb7b0128e72f5184b53
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。输入为标量 `initial_magmoms` 时必须开启；三列 `spin:R:3` 或向量 `initial_magmoms` "
"不需要抬升。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. It must be enabled for scalar `initial_magmoms`; three-column"
" `spin:R:3` or vector `initial_magmoms` requires no lifting."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:72
#: 119f6aaee320421b98fb4abca6b6c2e9
msgid "标量抬升方向（axis）"
msgstr "Scalar Lifting Direction (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:74
#: 33554b0ef6324b99abedc9108f95cc29
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 "
"`(0,0,1)`，使用笛卡尔坐标。仅用于将标量磁矩变成三维矢量，必须是有限非零向量；对已有向量磁矩不改变初始方向。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0,0,1)`, in Cartesian coordinates. Used only "
"to convert scalar moments into three-dimensional vectors. It must be finite and "
"nonzero and does not change the initial directions of existing vector moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:76
#: 80d16f4230e7409bb528359df4fa7cdf
msgid "模长采样（disturb_magnitude）"
msgstr "Magnitude Sampling (disturb_magnitude)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:78
#: 7a08cb1dee05433eb14bff0a06d69ef8
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。开启后，旋转完成的每个目标磁矩再乘以独立随机缩放因子。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, every rotated target moment is additionally "
"multiplied by an independent random scale factor."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:80
#: fc647155936240ff881326237bfd78a6
msgid "模长缩放范围（magnitude_factor）"
msgstr "Magnitude Scale Range (magnitude_factor)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:82
#: 7a1fabff5a0640e390f144c5a5420d68
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(0.8,1.2)`。依次为缩放因子下限和上限，对应输入磁矩模长约 ±20% "
"的随机涨落；两者必须有限、非负且下限不大于上限。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, default `(0.8,1.2)`. These are the lower and upper scale "
"factors, corresponding to random fluctuations of approximately ±20% around the input "
"moment magnitude. Both must be finite and nonnegative, with the lower bound no "
"greater than the upper bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:84
#: db9993f36aa74d259d921c49f23595cf
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:86
#: 334c28b3d1734befba2f90484e4691ab
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同结构、参数和 seed 得到相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, the same structure, parameters, and seed "
"produce the same results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:88
#: a0d1ab689c87490aa3b90d957314ea74
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:90
#: 436f319ee9294a41a7069707a30ac51d
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。随机流由该值和结构内容共同派生，因此数据集重新排序不会改变某一结构自己的结果。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. The random stream is derived jointly from this value and the "
"structure content, so reordering the dataset does not change a structure's own "
"results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:92
#: d3a0a81a0cfc402d963952c65cd704bb
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:94
#: 01758664f65b46d19aeefd2c0a040eb3
msgid "**为什么提示没有匹配的磁矩？** 目标元素没有出现在结构中，或命中原子的磁矩全为零。检查 `spin`/`initial_magmoms` 和目标元素。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are no matching moments reported?** The target element is absent from the "
"structure, or all moments on matched atoms are zero. Check `spin` / `initial_magmoms`"
" and the target elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:96
#: f62bc902b94a43b28e79044966c3ae1d
msgid "**为什么标量磁矩无法运行？** 开启“标量磁矩转为矢量”，并给出有限、非零的笛卡尔抬升方向；也可以先用“设置磁矩”统一为 `spin:R:3`。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can scalar moments not be processed?** Enable `Convert scalar moments to "
"vectors` and provide a finite, nonzero Cartesian lifting direction. Alternatively, "
"use Set Magnetic Moments first to standardize them as `spin:R:3`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:98
#: 8b81c25824f84cb69c8dcb70ca6d2e75
msgid "**与“可控自旋倾斜”有什么区别？** 本卡生成参考磁态周围的随机样本云；“可控自旋倾斜”按指定原子、原子对或分组生成确定性角度扫描。"
msgstr ""
"**How does this differ from Local Magnetic Response?** This card generates a random "
"sample cloud around a reference magnetic state. Local Magnetic Response generates "
"deterministic angle scans for specified atoms, atom pairs, or groups."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:100
#: 21889e1b780746afacc66985bd16cdd8
msgid "输出合同"
msgstr "Output Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:102
#: e9c488b727bd45bfa3b992b8659b7d29
msgid "每个输入严格生成 `num_structures` 个输出；输入不满足要求时明确失败；"
msgstr ""
"each input produces exactly `num_structures` outputs, and unmet input requirements "
"fail explicitly;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:103
#: 0ee5779a64564425bd5e71c1627c2553
msgid "原子、坐标、晶胞和 PBC 与输入一致，输出磁矩写入 `spin:R:3` 并同步 ASE `initial_magmoms`；"
msgstr ""
"atoms, coordinates, cell, and PBC match the input, while output moments are written "
"to `spin:R:3` and synchronized with ASE `initial_magmoms`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:104
#: eb9069967b7244c8984c7cf6720b96c6
msgid "`Config_type` 追加 `SpinPert(...)`；最大角度为 0、仅采样模长时追加 `SpinScale(...)`；"
msgstr ""
"`SpinPert(...)` is appended to `Config_type`; when the maximum angle is zero and only"
" magnitudes are sampled, `SpinScale(...)` is appended;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:105
#: 7dcbe627d3d84915b73a8e36f108f098
msgid "`spin_perturbation` metadata 记录球冠分布、目标元素、参数、seed、样本序号、目标数量、实际角度统计和实际缩放范围。"
msgstr ""
"the `spin_perturbation` metadata records the spherical-cap distribution, target "
"elements, parameters, seed, sample index, target count, realized angle statistics, "
"and realized scale range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:110
#: 5c3930cdeec6410ea31002291114c24f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticMomentRotationCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"max_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"num_structures\": 5,\n"
"    \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"disturb_magnitude\": true,\n"
"    \"magnitude_factor\": [0.8, 1.2],\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`Disturb Magnitude` = 勾选，`Magnitude Factor` = `[0.95, 1.05]`"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Disturb Magnitude` and set `Magnitude Factor` to `[0.95, 1.05]`."

#~ msgid "如果仍有方向敏感性问题，增大 `Max Angle` 到 15~20 度，或增加 `Num Structures`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If directional sensitivity remains, increase `Max"
#~ " Angle` to 15–20° or increase `Num "
#~ "Structures`, then re-evaluate held-out angular"
#~ " slices."

#~ msgid "如果特定元素的磁矩扰动后偏离物理合理范围，用 `Elements` 限制只扰动目标元素"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If perturbing a particular species produces "
#~ "implausible moments, use `Elements` to restrict "
#~ "the operation to the intended magnetic "
#~ "sublattice."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是共线标量磁矩时，是否先沿 `Axis` 抬升为向量再做旋转。输入是标量且需要旋转时必须开启。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `True`. Lift collinear scalar "
#~ "moments to vectors along `Axis` before "
#~ "rotation. This must be enabled when scalar "
#~ "input is to be rotated."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0,"
#~ " 0.0, 1.0)`。`lift_scalar` 抬升时使用的参考方向。输入已经是向量磁矩时此参数对初始方向无影响。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default:"
#~ " `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. Reference direction used "
#~ "by `lift_scalar`. It does not alter the "
#~ "initial direction of vector-valued input "
#~ "moments."

#~ msgid "**输出和输入一样。** 检查输入是否有 `initial_magmoms`。标量磁矩需开 `Lift Scalar`。`Max Angle` 不能为 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The output is unchanged.** Confirm that the"
#~ " input has `initial_magmoms`, enable `Lift "
#~ "Scalar` for scalar moments, and ensure `Max"
#~ " Angle` is nonzero."

#~ msgid "**输出磁矩全是零。** `Elements` 过滤掉了所有有磁矩的元素，或 `Magnitude Factor` 下限为 0 且被采样到。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**All output moments are zero.** `Elements` "
#~ "may exclude every magnetic species, or the "
#~ "magnitude-factor range may include zero. "
#~ "Correct the element scope and scaling "
#~ "interval."

#~ msgid "**每次运行结果不同。** 未开启 `Use Seed`。需要可复现时勾选并固定 `Seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Results differ between runs.** Enable `Use "
#~ "Seed` and fix `Seed` for reproducibility."

#~ msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。每次旋转的随机轴和角度由 seed + 结构序号联合控制。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce"
#~ " the same result for the same input. "
#~ "Each random axis and angle is determined "
#~ "jointly by the seed and structure index."

#~ msgid "所有输出写入 `initial_magmoms` 数组。"
#~ msgstr "All outputs are written to the `initial_magmoms` array."

#~ msgid "磁矩旋转（Magmom Rotation）"
#~ msgstr "Magnetic-Moment Rotation (Magmom Rotation)"

#~ msgid "对已存在的磁矩做随机小角度旋转，并可选地扰动模长。每个输入结构输出多个旋转版本，用于补充自旋方向附近的连续构型邻域数据。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply random small-angle rotations to existing"
#~ " moments and optionally perturb their magnitudes."
#~ " Multiple variants per input provide continuous"
#~ " local coverage around a reference spin "
#~ "direction."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\mathbf{m}'=\\lambda\\,\\mathbf{R}(\\hat{\\mathbf{n}},\\theta)\\,\\mathbf{m},\\quad"
#~ " \\lambda\\in[f_{\\min},f_{\\max}]"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "$\\mathbf R(\\hat{\\mathbf n},\\theta)$ 是绕单位轴 "
#~ "$\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 的三维旋转矩阵， $\\theta$ "
#~ "在零到最大旋转角之间抽样；$\\lambda$ 是可选的模长缩放。只旋转方向时 $\\lambda=1$，所以 "
#~ "$|\\mathbf m'|=|\\mathbf m|$。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "$\\mathbf R(\\hat{\\mathbf n},\\theta)$ is the "
#~ "three-dimensional rotation matrix about unit axis"
#~ " $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$. Sample $\\theta$ between "
#~ "zero and the maximum rotation angle; "
#~ "$\\lambda$ optionally scales the magnitude. For "
#~ "direction-only rotations, $\\lambda=1$, so "
#~ "$|\\mathbf m'|=|\\mathbf m|$."

#~ msgid "**关键限制：** 这张卡只做随机旋转和模长缩放，不改变晶体结构，不定义新的磁序。它依赖输入已有 `initial_magmoms`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Scope:** This card only rotates and rescales"
#~ " moments. It neither changes atomic geometry "
#~ "nor defines a new magnetic order, and it"
#~ " requires existing `initial_magmoms`."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在 MD 中遇到自旋方向涨落就崩"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: model errors rise sharply when spin directions fluctuate during MD"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你训练了一个 NEP 磁性模型，所有训练数据里磁矩方向都是严格对齐的（FM 全同向、AFM "
#~ "严格翻转）。静态推理表现完美，但一跑有限温度 MD——原子磁矩受热涨落发生 5~10 度的小角度偏转——力的误差直接翻倍。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained a magnetic NEP model using "
#~ "only perfectly aligned moments: parallel in FM"
#~ " states and exactly reversed in AFM states."
#~ " Static predictions are accurate, but in "
#~ "finite-temperature MD a 5–10° thermal deflection"
#~ " of local moments doubles the force error."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** "
#~ "训练集只覆盖了磁矩方向空间的离散点，模型在这些点之间只能外推。需要在每个参考磁态周围加一批小角度旋转样本，让模型\"见过\"自旋在参考方向附近连续变化的环境。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** The training set covers only "
#~ "isolated points in moment-direction space, "
#~ "forcing interpolation gaps to behave like "
#~ "extrapolation. Add small-angle samples around "
#~ "each reference state so the model learns "
#~ "a continuous neighborhood of spin orientations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 一个已写入 `initial_magmoms` 的磁性结构（来自 `Magnetic "
#~ "Order` 或 `Set Magnetic Moments` 的上游输出）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A magnetic structure with "
#~ "`initial_magmoms`, typically produced by `Magnetic "
#~ "Order` or `Set Magnetic Moments`."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 对每个输入帧生成 5 个旋转版本，最大旋转角 10 度，模长扰动 ±5%，覆盖自旋方向附近的连续邻域"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** Generate five variants per input "
#~ "with rotations up to 10° and magnitude "
#~ "scaling of ±5%, covering a local neighborhood"
#~ " around each reference direction."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`最大旋转角`（`max_angle`） = `10.0`"
#~ msgstr "`Maximum rotation angle` (`max_angle`) = `10.0`"

#~ msgid "`生成结构数`（`num_structures`） = `5`"
#~ msgstr "`Structures to generate` (`num_structures`) = `5`"

#~ msgid "`扰动磁矩大小`（`disturb_magnitude`） = 勾选，`磁矩缩放系数`（`magnitude_factor`） = `[0.95, 1.05]`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `Perturb moment magnitude` (`disturb_magnitude`)"
#~ " and set `Moment scaling factor` "
#~ "(`magnitude_factor`) to `[0.95, 1.05]`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 每输入帧 5 个结构，磁矩方向在 0~10 度范围内随机偏离，模长在 95%~105% 之间浮动。原子位置不变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Five structures per input. Moment "
#~ "directions are randomly deflected by 0–10°, "
#~ "magnitudes are scaled to 95–105%, and atomic"
#~ " positions are unchanged."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后跑有限温度 MD，检查力的 MAE 是否比之前更稳定"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, rerun the"
#~ " finite-temperature validation and check whether"
#~ " force MAE remains stable under directional "
#~ "fluctuations."

#~ msgid "如果仍有方向敏感性问题，增大 `最大旋转角`（`max_angle`）到 15~20 度，或增加 `生成结构数`（`num_structures`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If direction sensitivity remains, increase `Maximum"
#~ " rotation angle` (`max_angle`) to 15–20 degrees"
#~ " or increase `Structures to generate` "
#~ "(`num_structures`)."

#~ msgid "如果特定元素的磁矩扰动后偏离物理合理范围，用 `元素`（`elements`）限制只扰动目标元素"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If perturbations push a particular element's "
#~ "moments outside a physically reasonable range, "
#~ "use `Elements` (`elements`) to perturb only "
#~ "the target elements."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "训练集只有固定方向的磁态，模型对方向涨落敏感"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The training set contains only fixed magnetic"
#~ " directions and the model is sensitive to"
#~ " directional fluctuations."

#~ msgid "做有限温度 MD 或自旋动力学，需要连续的方向覆盖"
#~ msgstr "Finite-temperature MD or spin dynamics requires continuous directional coverage."

#~ msgid "上游已有可信磁矩，只需在附近做小幅度采样"
#~ msgstr "The upstream moments are trusted and only local sampling around them is needed."

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "输入没有初始磁矩 → 先用 `Set Magnetic Moments` 或 `Magnetic Order`"
#~ msgstr "The input has no moments → use `Set Magnetic Moments` or `Magnetic Order` first."

#~ msgid "需要方向大范围覆盖（40°+）→ 用 `Small-Angle Spin Tilt` 确定性扫描"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You need broad angular coverage of 40° "
#~ "or more → use a deterministic `Small-"
#~ "Angle Spin Tilt` scan."

#~ msgid "只需要模长扰动不需要方向变化 → 这张卡的旋转功能白费了"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Only magnitude variation is needed → choose"
#~ " a workflow that does not introduce "
#~ "unnecessary rotations."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。逗号分隔的元素列表，如 `Fe,Co`——只对列出的元素做旋转和模长扰动。留空则全部磁性原子参与。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `''`. Comma-separated symbols "
