#~ "lightweight augmentation and 10–30 for routine "
#~ "coverage. For more than 30, follow with "
#~ "representative filtering."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是共线标量磁矩时，是否先沿 `轴`（`axis`）抬升为向量再做旋转。输入是标量且需要旋转时必须开启。"
